  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta projekt leds av en intressant mix av NGO:er, universitet etc    f&#xf6;r att fokusera p&#xe5; sm&#xe5;skalig uppf&#xf6;dning av insekter bland            sm&#xe5;brukare. Projektet avser ocks&#xe5; att bidra till en marknad och       v&#xe4;rdekedja f&#xf6;r insekter och/eller livsmedel gjorda p&#xe5; insekter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;This project is led by an interesting diverse mix of NGOs,           universities etc to focus on small scale breedning of insects for     human consumption by smallholders. The project also mentions on       creating a market and supply chain for insects and/or food products   made of insects.&quot; (PWC Project Summary)</narrative>
  </description>
